      "message": "This will result in a requestLayout and setTabSelected is called as part of onMeasure in this view. Requesting layout during a layout pass can cause problems.\n\nWe should probably do something something more direct instead of setTabSelected to animate to the currently selected tab after the size has changed to avoid this.",
